    "body": "Well spotted! This is indeed a bug! Actually, there was an issue with the doc-building test (it turns out that sphinx-build needs the flag `-W` in order to return `1` and signal that to the user) ... so we were fooled by tests always being green! \r\n\r\nI have started fixing this and issue #106 too. \r\n\r\nRegarding the status of the underlying docstrings: the result one should be fairly complete, while the logger one requires some improvements. ",
